{"full":"hf:DataPrism/Research-Assistant","spaceId":"DataPrism/Research-Assistant","name":"AI-Research-Assistant","source":"huggingface","description":"An interactive AI application on Hugging Face Spaces.","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"Python","topics":["gradio","region:us"],"technologies":["Python"],"likes":7,"created":"2023-08-18T12:29:11.000Z","updated":"2023-08-18T12:29:12.000Z","license":null,"runtime":"SLEEPING","appUrl":"https://dataprism-research-assistant.hf.space/","demo":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/DataPrism/Research-Assistant","availability":"available","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T20:59:14.279Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T20:59:14.279Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T20:59:14.279Z","color":"#3c3250","ink":"#e4d4ff","symbol":"✦","overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Inspired by gpt-researcher. This project endeavors to develop an AI research assistant capable of generating research reports effortlessly for researchers. For instance, researchers can request the AI research assistant to compose a report on the latest advancements in the field of superconductors as of 2023, which is currently a trending topic. The AI research assistant will subsequently compile a report based on the relevant information obtained from the internet. Now, AIRA also offers support for academic English polishing.","The currently supported agents encompass a wide range of fields, including finance, business analysis, clinical medicine, basic medicine, travel, academic research and sociology.","In addition to official api, this project offers an alternative approach to generating research reports by utilizing a third-party API. For access to this third-party API, please refer to chimeragpt or GPT-API-free. Before running the project, kindly ensure that you set the environment variables OPENAIAPIKEY and OPENAIAPIBASE."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/DataPrism/Research-Assistant/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"05a2b